<h3 data-start=3D"2367" data-end=3D"2378">=F0=9F=A7=A0 Tips</h3>
<ul data-start=3D"2379" data-end=3D"2726">
<li data-start=3D"2379" data-end=3D"2566">
<p data-start=3D"2381" data-end=3D"2566"><code data-start=3D"2381" data-end=
=3D"2390">ToAscii</code> works best for alphanumeric keys, but may not hand=
le everything (e.g., multimedia or Unicode input). For more advanced decodi=
ng, consider <code data-start=3D"2529" data-end=3D"2540">ToUnicode</code> (=
wide-character support).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2567" data-end=3D"2726">
<p data-start=3D"2569" data-end=3D"2726">This polling technique is <strong =
data-start=3D"2595" data-end=3D"2622">active and consumes CPU</strong>, so =
it=E2=80=99s best used with minimal sleep (<code data-start=3D"2662" data-e=
nd=3D"2671">10-50ms</code>) and intelligent debounce/deduplication in produ=
ction.</p>
</li>
</ul>
