</ul>
<hr data-start=3D"406" data-end=3D"409">
<h2 data-start=3D"411" data-end=3D"427">=F0=9F=94=8D Root Cause</h2>
<p data-start=3D"429" data-end=3D"487">Simply hooking <code data-start=3D"4=
44" data-end=3D"463">SetWindowsHookExA</code> <strong data-start=3D"464" da=
ta-end=3D"481">is not enough</strong>. Why?</p>
<ol data-start=3D"489" data-end=3D"800">
