<hr data-start=3D"2207" data-end=3D"2210">
<h2 data-start=3D"2212" data-end=3D"2232">=F0=9F=94=90 Why This Works</h2>
<ul data-start=3D"2234" data-end=3D"2485">
<li data-start=3D"2234" data-end=3D"2298">
<p data-start=3D"2236" data-end=3D"2298">Malware=E2=80=99s <code data-start=
=3D"2246" data-end=3D"2268">LowLevelKeyboardProc</code> returns <code data-=
start=3D"2277" data-end=3D"2298">CallNextHookEx(...)</code></p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2299" data-end=3D"2400">
<p data-start=3D"2301" data-end=3D"2400">We intercept <code data-start=3D"2=
314" data-end=3D"2330">CallNextHookEx</code> and return a fake <code data-s=
tart=3D"2349" data-end=3D"2352">1</code>, <strong data-start=3D"2354" data-=
end=3D"2366">blocking</strong> all lower-level hook propagation.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"2401" data-end=3D"2485">
<p data-start=3D"2403" data-end=3D"2485">This makes the hook <strong data-s=
tart=3D"2423" data-end=3D"2433">silent</strong> and ineffective, even thoug=
h it remains registered.</p>
</li>
</ul>
